@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## Why
+
+Services need a standard way to refer to a value inside a JSON document. RFC 6901 (JSON Pointer) is that standard, and later features of json-toolkit will build on it.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, that returns the value a JSON Pointer refers to.
+- It throws when the pointer is not a valid RFC 6901 pointer, or when it does not resolve to a value of the document.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-pointer`: parsing and resolving RFC 6901 JSON Pointers against a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code in `src/`; new public export `resolvePointer`. No dependencies added. No existing behavior changes.
